%% Animated calculus & fields (lemur.anim): Taylor, Fourier, Riemann, a vector
%% field, and the derivative — with text and formulas baked in.
!title Calculus, animated
!madewith

!slide Taylor series: approximating sin x

!anim
	!src taylor.py

!slide A square wave from its harmonics

!anim
	!src fourier.py

!slide Riemann sums → the area

!anim
	!src riemann.py

!slide A vector field and a streamline

!anim
	!src field.py

!slide The derivative as a moving tangent

!anim
	!src tangent.py
